  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The previous behavior of the \"Date Added\" sort (that was deemed \"inaccurate\" and changed to respect the avatars' upload dates in build 1642) had a unique use case: manually arranging avatars in the menu by un-favoriting and re-favoriting them to bump them to the top of the list.\n\nThis was helpful for ensuring certain avatars would appear in a specific order (especially in wings) to keep navigation familiar and \"mains\" or other frequently-used avatars on top of the pile. A custom order mode would accomplish this through officially-suported means.\n\nThis could involve a simple \"move to top\" option in the client with a more intuitive click-and-drag implementation on the website.",
